flowchart LR
    callers[Calling team backends]
    eng[ML engineers]
    subgraph gke[GKE]
        gw[Inference gateway]
    end
    subgraph modelnet[Model network]
        ms[Model server]
        redis[(Redis feature store)]
    end
    registry[(Model registry bucket)]
    log[(Inference log)]

    callers -->|inference request| gw
    gw -->|request| ms
    registry -->|model artifacts| ms
    redis -->|customer features| ms
    gw -->|"requests + responses"| log
    eng -->|publish model artifacts| registry
